# Coordinator Pattern

## BaseCoordinator
- `childCoordinators`, `addChild`, `removeChild`
- `start()` override để bắt đầu flow

## AppCoordinator
- Quản lý `showAuth` vs `showMain` theo `context.isLoggedIn`
- Window rootViewController = nav hoặc tabBarController

## Tab Coordinator (MainCoordinator)
- `tabBarController` với các tab: Clans, Messages, Notifications, Profile
- Mỗi tab = `UINavigationController(rootViewController: vc)`
- Clans tab: `HomeViewController` (embed ClanList + ChannelList)

## Navigation
- Push: `navigationController?.pushViewController(vc, animated: true)`
- Present sheet: `present(UINavigationController(rootViewController: vc), animated: true)` với `sheetPresentationController`

## Flow callback
- ViewModel expose `onXxxSelected: ((Params) -> Void)?`
- Parent VC/Coordinator set callback, thực hiện navigation
